he fault Forced disconnection of the bar N\u00b01 66 kV of S/E San Vicente occurred, by opening the switches 52AT3 and 52BT3 of S/E San Vicente, caused by an attempt of manual reconnection without success of the switch 52C3-A of this S/E, during the recovery of consumptions of that cloth with occasion of a failure occurred at 22:03 hours of the same day, analyzed in the EAF 218/2024, due to a mechanical abnormality in the attempt to open the switch 52C3-A. d.2 Physical Phenomenon: OPE26: Failure in the system of protection or control. d.3 Reitation: Phenomenon Physical reiteratation in the affected installation: This installation has been","es":"Estudio para an\u00e1lisis de falla EAF 219/2024\n\u201cDesconexi\u00f3n forzada de la barra N\u00b01 66 kV de S/E San Vicente\u201d\nFecha de Emisi\u00f3n: 10-06-2024\n1. Descripci\u00f3n pormenorizada de la perturbaci\u00f3n\n1. Fecha y Hora de la falla\nFecha 19/05/2024\nHora 23:23\nConsumos desconectados (MW) 0.4\nDemanda previa del sistema (MW) 10447.00\nPorcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n 0.004 %\nCalificaci\u00f3n Apag\u00f3n No aplica (porcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n < 10%)\n2. Identificaci\u00f3n instalaci\u00f3n afectada\nNombre de la instalaci\u00f3n S/E Cementos B\u00edo B\u00edo / SE001L0024\nTipo de instalaci\u00f3n Subestaci\u00f3n\nTensi\u00f3n nominal 66 kV\nSegmento Transmisi\u00f3n Dedicado\nPropietario instalaci\u00f3n afectada Cementos B\u00edo B\u00edo del Sur S.A.\nRUT 96.755.490-1\nRepresentante Legal Guido Efrens Sep\u00falveda Navarro\nDirecci\u00f3n Avda. Gran Breta\u00f1a 1725, Talcahuano, Regi\u00f3n de Biob\u00edo.\n- Datos correspondientes al Gerente General de la empresa propietaria de la instalaci\u00f3n afectada, obtenidos de la plataforma\nREUC del Coordinador; no fueron remitidos los datos correspondientes al Representante Legal.\n3. Identificaci\u00f3n del elemento fallado\nNombre del elemento afectado Sistema de protecci\u00f3n del pa\u00f1o C3-A de S/E San Vicente /\nPA001T0002SE035T0002 (*)\nPropietario elemento fallado Transelec S.A.\nRUT 76.555.400-4\nRepresentante Legal Arturo Le Blanc\nDirecci\u00f3n Orinoco 90, piso 14, Las Condes, Regi\u00f3n Metropolitana de Santiago\n- Nemot\u00e9cnico asociado al pa\u00f1o C3-A de S/E San Vicente.\nd.1 Origen y causa de la falla\nSe produjo la desconexi\u00f3n forzada de la barra N\u00b01 66 kV de S/E San Vicente, mediante la apertura de\nlos interruptores 52AT3 y 52BT3 de S/E San Vicente, ocasionada por un intento de reconexi\u00f3n manual\nsin \u00e9xito del interruptor 52C3-A de esta S/E, durante la recuperaci\u00f3n de consumos de dicho pa\u00f1o con\nocasi\u00f3n de una falla ocurrida a las 22:03 horas del mismo d\u00eda, analizado en al EAF 2","shown_language":"en","word_scores":[{"w":"study","s":0.19},{"w":"failure","s":0.12},{"w":"analysis","s":-0.04},{"w":"eaf","s":0.03},{"w":"2024","s":-0.03},{"w":"forced","s":-0.5},{"w":"disconnection","s":-0.14},{"w":"bar","s":-0.56},{"w":"66","s":-0.37},{"w":"kv","s":-0.19},{"w":"san","s":0.26},{"w":"date","s":0.04},{"w":"description","s":0.03},{"w":"date","s":0.04},{"w":"failure","s":0.12},{"w":"date","s":0.04},{"w":"19","s":0.06},{"w":"05","s":-0.14},{"w":"2024","s":-0.03},{"w":"23","s":-1.0},{"w":"23","s":-1.0},{"w":"consumptions","s":-0.01},{"w":"mw","s":-0.04},{"w":"prior","s":0.18},{"w":"mw","s":-0.04},{"w":"00","s":0.21},{"w":"percentage","s":0.21},{"w":"disconnection","s":-0.14}]},"predictions":{"conflux":{"pred":"breaker_fault","display_pred":"BREAKER FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.3134,"breaker_fault":0.5449,"transformer_fault":0.004,"busbar_fault":0.1377},"confidence":0.5449,"correct":false},"quorum":{"pred":"line_fault","display_pred":"LINE FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.3669,"breaker_fault":0.3657,"transformer_fault":0.0714,"busbar_fault":0.196},"confidence":0.3669,"correct":false},"nexus":{"pred":"breaker_fault","display_pred":"BREAKER FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.3008,"breaker_fault":0.4779,"transformer_fault":0.0983,"busbar_fault":0.1231},"confid